  "notes": "{吹|ふ}っ{飛|と}ぶ is an emphatic compound of {吹|ふ}く (to blow) and {飛|と}ぶ (to fly), with the っ indicating sudden, forceful action.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {吹|ふ}っ{飛|と}ばす (transitive, to blow something away)\n\nCOMMON FIGURATIVE USES:\n- {眠気|ねむけ}が{吹|ふ}っ{飛|と}ぶ (sleepiness vanishes)\n- {疲|つか}れが{吹|ふ}っ{飛|と}ぶ (tiredness disappears)\n- {計画|けいかく}が{吹|ふ}っ{飛|と}ぶ (plans are blown away / ruined)",
